# --- SUMMER (the south islet): palms and mangoes, watermelons, the summer sky (and its autumn gold, hidden); the diver's
# hut by the lagoon with his log on its post and a box under it; the reef off the islet - corals, the sunken summer bell
# on its stone with the summer token's chest by it, two pockets of air under the coral, turtles ----------------------------
push at -42.25 -82.25 h=4.05
call stilt_hut y=1.2
place Pickup_Landmark_Plank_Land - at 1.3 3.0 y=1.5 drop yaw=15
place Pickup_Landmark_Plastic3_Land - at 3.0 1.5 y=1.5 drop yaw=228
