quest title=The Year's Wheel
quest intro=An atoll stuck in four seasons at once, and in its lagoon a weather-house with a stopped wheel. Maren's almanac is on the lectern.
# Chapter 1 - the weather-house
step reach|weatherhouse|1|Row out to the weather-house in the lagoon
step read|Maren's almanac|1|Read Maren's almanac
step open|Weather-keeper's locker|1|Open the weather-keeper's locker
# Chapter 2 - winter
step reach|winter|1|Land on the winter islet
step read|The frost shrine's verse|1|Read the verse on the frost shrine
step kill|Polar bear|1|Face the frost bear at the foot of the ice spire
step reach|icecrown|1|Climb the ice spire
step collect|story:token|1|Take winter's token from the box of ice
# Chapter 3 - spring
step reach|spring|1|Land on the spring islet
step read|The shepherdess's note|1|Read the shepherdess's note on the pen gate
step catch|Goat|3|Net the three runaway lambs
step collect|story:token|2|Take spring's token from the shepherdess's box
# Chapter 4 - summer
step reach|summer|1|Land on the summer islet
step read|The diver's log|1|Read the diver's log
step reach|reef|1|Dive to the reef (breathe under the coral overhangs)
step collect|story:token|3|Take summer's token from under the sunken bell
# Chapter 5 - autumn
step reach|autumn|1|Land on the autumn islet
step read|The harvest rhyme|1|Read the harvest rhyme on the barn door
step kill|Warthog|3|Drive the boars out of the orchard
step collect|story:token|4|Ring the harvest bells in the rhyme's order and take autumn's token
# Chapter 6 - the turning
step reach|wheelroom|1|Bring the four tokens back to the wheel room in the weather-house
step collect|story:yearseed|1|Lay the four tokens in the year's wheel
step read|Maren's last page|1|Read the page that fell out of the wheel
step open|Weather-keeper's chest|1|Open Maren's chest
quest done=The year's wheel turns and the four islets slide round into their next seasons. Maren's atoll keeps time again.
quest reward=Seed_Strawberry*3;Seed_Watermelon*3;Rope*3

save Four Seasons
